          "message": "lib/string/sprintf/, tests/unit/test_xasprintf.c: x[v]asprintf_(): Transform these wrappers\n\nWrap [v]asprintf_() instead of [v]asprintf(3).\n\nRepurpose x[v]asprintf()'s tests to test x[v]asprintf_().\n\nSigned-off-by: Alejandro Colomar <alx@kernel.org>",
