        "body": "Bumps the submodules-junior group with 5 updates:\n\n| Package | From | To |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| [plugins/robots/thirdparty/trikRuntime/trikRuntime](https://github.com/trikset/trikRuntime) | ``7aee5cd`` | ``f391562`` |\n| [qrtest/thirdparty/googletest/googletest](https://github.com/google/googletest) | ``e47544a`` | ``7d76a23`` |\n| [thirdparty/gamepad/gamepad](https://github.com/trikset/trik-desktop-gamepad) | ``4b7aa17`` | ``e5a3f38`` |\n| [thirdparty/quazip/quazip](https://github.com/stachenov/quazip) | ``9d3aa3e`` | ``8aeb3f7`` |\n| [thirdparty/checkapp/checkapp](https://github.com/trikset/trik-checkapp) | ``14cd224`` | ``a30fcae`` |\n\nUpdates `plugins/robots/thirdparty/trikRuntime/trikRuntime` from `7aee5cd` to `f391562`\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/trikset/trikRuntime/commit/f391562a0ca5ee014605d2ca6f16c9b38e2d5956\"><code>f391562</code></a> Bump PythonQt/PythonQt from <code>811a928</code> to <code>79653a8</code> (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/trikset/trikRuntime/issues/812\">#812</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/trikset/trikRuntime/commit/3bc464ac114f52d2ed760e0ba01cad7045f61e19\"><code>3bc464a</code></a> Fix the deadlock in trikPythonRunner (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/trikset/trikRuntime/issues/809\">#809</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/trikset/trikRuntime/commit/5806271a8d001ba6b3ffd0f99611c1f7dc080447\"><code>5806271</code></a> Add support for PWM servo mode and PWM capture mode. (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/trikset/trikRuntime/issues/805\">#805</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/trikset/trikRuntime/commit/738c35205cb51c2e81cfb14e4fc2a7fdb497cfbc\"><code>738c352</code></a> Remove unnecessary ip verification (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/trikset/trikRuntime/issues/808\">#808</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/trikset/trikRuntime/commit/65987eafe76357ce68e076838d4f4b105e86773a\"><code>65987ea</code></a> Increase the wait for the JavaSrcript thread (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/trikset/trikRuntime/issues/807\">#807</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/trikset/trikRuntime/commit/aa0a642fc4865c4997d4ebac07b56ca4390ac243\"><code>aa0a642</code></a> Add PythonQt make check target when testing trikRuntime (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/trikset/trikRuntime/issues/806\">#806</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/trikset/trikRuntime/commit/14a119dd8ed1ec520925370da46012d2f90875c1\"><code>14a119d</code></a> Add option for PythonQt::init</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/trikset/trikRuntime/commit/6756829c7d0bdeacd947841c9f5ad5be4fbf0178\"><code>6756829</code></a> Bump PythonQt/PythonQt from <code>a9ad8ea</code> to <code>811a928</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/trikset/trikRuntime/commit/ae661b41fe5f60e61edea73ce550d6fe05243680\"><code>ae661b4</code></a> CI improvements (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/trikset/trikRuntime/issues/785\">#785</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/trikset/trikRuntime/commit/4bf5d4764eccb931aca3ed95750b66a0afea3f5c\"><code>4bf5d47</code></a> Fix memory leak in trikScriptRunner</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a href=\"https://github.com/trikset/trikRuntime/compare/7aee5cdb25f5ea38bbc1007975646549edd16e66...f391562a0ca5ee014605d2ca6f16c9b38e2d5956\">compare view</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\nUpdates `qrtest/thirdparty/googletest/googletest` from `e47544a` to `7d76a23`\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/google/googletest/commit/7d76a231b0e29caf86e68d1df858308cd53b2a66\"><code>7d76a23</code></a> gtest: Output a canned test case for test suite setup / teardown failures in ...</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/google/googletest/commit/e54519b09463cec3aea77a1739e02c97ca766da5\"><code>e54519b</code></a> Put the fake Fuchsia SDK in a module extension</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/google/googletest/commit/f3c355f9dd382bc2c323be27