code></a> Fix qtzlib support for Qt6, add CI tests</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/stachenov/quazip/commit/1f7b9280d61dfb57314c871244eb71391f73a034\"><code>1f7b928</code></a> Update README.md</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/stachenov/quazip/commit/6cbafcf5c63dd28263996d9a3b5bc5bbeeefddba\"><code>6cbafcf</code></a> lock down CI token permissions (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/stachenov/quazip/issues/196\">#196</a>)</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a href=\"https://github.com/stachenov/quazip/compare/9d3aa3ee948c1cde5a9f873ecbc3bb229c1182ee...8aeb3f7d8254f4bf1f7c6cf2a8f59c2ca141a552\">compare view</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\nUpdates `thirdparty/checkapp/checkapp` from `14cd224` to `a30fcae`\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/trikset/trik-checkapp/commit/a30fcae8aae6cd5ff43cc5b79187dfcd2a0ff48c\"><code>a30fcae</code></a> Bump cpp-linter/cpp-linter-action from 2.13.2 to 2.13.4</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/trikset/trik-checkapp/commit/11bb4875802132bcc51f21d12cbfc8cbc03714e6\"><code>11bb487</code></a> Bump MinyazevR/clazy-standalone-action from 0.2.0 to 0.2.1</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/trikset/trik-checkapp/commit/c20b1c1c6b154bd65c7f98d6cba2ab4a89c1050c\"><code>c20b1c1</code></a> Bump cpp-linter/cpp-linter-action from 2.13.1 to 2.13.2</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/trikset/trik-checkapp/commit/f735508b461d49d3ee4c0ad5f86141be69ba2ca5\"><code>f735508</code></a> Bump cpp-linter/cpp-linter-action from 2.12.1 to 2.13.1</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/trikset/trik-checkapp/commit/dc4922b0c27a7041e2aeb43ebc670f6b7d2e292e\"><code>dc4922b</code></a> Bump cpp-linter/cpp-linter-action from 2.12.0 to 2.12.1</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/trikset/trik-checkapp/commit/d2bc3f3b75d883f53fe3d953e059d52ab6123c35\"><code>d2bc3f3</code></a> Fix ci</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/trikset/trik-checkapp/commit/28330610c4658cd18be8f272ff707fec9aae3f08\"><co