        "body": "This is really great! I love the minimalistic structure you made. As mentioned I just needed to install the SDL2 development package (On Ubuntu, sudo apt-get install libsdl2-dev). In future we would want to train our own models, focusing on very diverse data. See e.g. https://github.com/secretsauceai/precise-wakeword-model-maker, In addition, we could see what preprocessing tricks, like noise suppression, voice activity detection, dereverberation could be useful.",
