        "active_lock_reason": null,
        "body": "**Describe the bug**\r\n\r\nMy GPU's sensors have stopped being recognized a couple of days ago, likely due to updating my drivers.\r\nI installed the newest driver version from AMD (24.12.1) and have been experiencing issues since. \r\nscreenshot of error:\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e450c5c4-7a0b-4e73-bb4a-18230b241d6d)\r\n\r\n**Is there a log.txt file next to FanControl.exe with recent date entries?**\r\nLink to log.txt: https://pastebin.com/eRbQyXYS\r\n\r\n**Relevant hardware specs and setup**\r\nRunning an AMD RX 7900 GRE GPU, 5800x3D CPU, ASUS B450-PLUS TUF GAMING II motherboard.  Windows 11.\r\n",
