        "created_at": "2025-01-01T15:22:19Z",
        "updated_at": "2025-01-01T15:22:19Z",
        "author_association": "NONE",
        "body": "Problem solved for myself . It was a windows update issue ... It replaced the drivers with a weird AMD version automatically after a DDU cleaning, even if I have deactivated the automatic drivers download in the system properties .\r\nI solved the problem by performing a DDU cleaning in safe mode, rebooting with my PC physically disconnected from network, instaling the latest AMD drivers . After that, the GPU temp and hotspot temp were back in the temperatur source menu in fan control.\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/682c5fbc-13fd-44e3-9084-b531ab54fe83)\r\n",
