        "body": "hey, sorry for the delay, what I meant is this part:\r\n\r\nHost Trigger Event Mode\r\nParameter #790\r\nRS5100 is compatible with the STB3678 cradle and apps that utilize Zebra Scanner SDK, as well as Zebra host terminals apps that use EMDK. However, appropriate host trigger event mode has to be selected when partnering with those devices. RS5100 selects appropriate mode automatically, based on the pairing barcode, but it can be also manually set in case an appropriate pairing barcode is not used.\r\nUse Host Trigger Event disabled mode for pairing with STB3678 cradle or Zebra Scanner SDK apps and utilities running on Windows, Android, or Apple iOS.\r\n\r\nNote,  when you test with the sample app from Zebra (Scanner Control), it will automatically reset to defaults when you pair, so switch it off in the app settings (AppSettings -> Set Factory Defaults to false)",
