        "body": "Another benchmark with a funky 8-port from the internet. Probably a measurement of a backplane.\r\n\r\nVector fitting results from scikit-rf:\r\n![Backplane_fitted](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e2a970d1-b54a-47f2-b249-aa03d4a7d1ee)\r\n\r\nSP simulation results from ngspice\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a7b834a3-cf7b-4916-846f-8530cfa335d9)\r\n\r\nInventory and rusage from ngspice:\r\n```\r\nCircuit Inventory\r\n\r\nCapacitor: 11328\r\nCCCS: 8\r\nInductor: 11264\r\nResistor: 22664\r\nVCCS: 33928\r\nVsource: 16\r\n```\r\n\r\n```\r\nTotal elapsed time (seconds) = 98.120 \r\nTotal DRAM available = 15673.430 MB.\r\nDRAM currently available = 7191.707 MB.\r\nMaximum ngspice program size =  665.574 MB.\r\nCurrent ngspice program size =  636.121 MB.\r\n\r\nShared ngspice pages =   11.422 MB.\r\nText (code) pages =    5.992 MB.\r\nStack = 0 bytes.\r\nLibrary pages =  642.000 MB.\r\n\r\nNumber of lines in the deck = 181064\r\nNetlist loading time = 0.106\r\nSubckt and Param expansion time = 0.61\r\nNetlist parsing time = 0.201\r\n\r\nNominal temperature = 27\r\nOperating temperature = 27\r\nTotal iterations = 3\r\nTransient iterations = 0\r\nCircuit Equations = 33961\r\nCircuit original non-zeroes = 135808\r\nCircuit fill-in non-zeroes = 109457\r\nCircuit total non-zeroes = 0\r\nTransient timepoints = 0\r\nAccepted timepoints = 0\r\nRejected timepoints = 0\r\nTotal analysis time (seconds) = 97.398\r\nMatrix load time = 7.005\r\nMatrix synchronize time = 0\r\nMatrix reorder time = 4.95\r\nMatrix factor time = 5.323\r\nMatrix solve time = 8.892\r\nTransient analysis time = 0\r\nTransient load time = 0\r\nTransient sync time = 0\r\nTransient factor time = 0\r\nTransient solve time = 0\r\nTransient trunc time = 0\r\nTransient iterations for the last time point = 3\r\nAC analysis time = 92.339\r\nAC load time = 6.956\r\nAC sync time = 0\r\nAC factor time = 5.305\r\nAC solve time = 8.888\r\n```",
